WEBVTT

00:00:00.167 --> 00:00:02.768
Step by step. Advance when ready.

00:00:03.233 --> 00:00:10.524
Learn the snatch, clean and jerk in order. Position first, then movement, then speed, then weight.

00:00:10.967 --> 00:00:16.029
Each step shows how to do it. A checklist tells you when you are ready to move on.

00:00:16.467 --> 00:00:21.808
Mark a step done and the next one is up. Your progress is saved.

00:00:22.267 --> 00:00:28.583
Twelve steps take you from an overhead hold to a full snatch. The clean has nine steps. The jerk has eight.

00:00:29.033 --> 00:00:32.702
Download Barforge Weightlifting. No account. Free to start.
